<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WORLD XV WIN SANYO CUP.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WORLD XV WIN SANYO CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A World XV beat Wasps of England 52-31 (halftime 17-17) to win the Sanyo Cup at Twickenham on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>World XV - Tries: Waisale Serevi (3), Marika Vanbuka (2), David Campese, Willie Ofahengaue, Philippe Sella. Conversions: Sebastian Viars (6).</p>
<p>Wasps - Tries: Kenny Logan (2), Steve Roiser, Buster White. Conversions: Gareth Rees (4). Penalty: Rees.</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000.</p>
